            <div xml:id="d440">

                <pb facs="0627" n="537" sameAs="frus:frus1934v03/pg537"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.6593/14: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Long</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-09-26T14:00:00+01:00">September 26, 1934—2
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received September 26—8:40 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>208. Following Stefani communiqué just issued to be published this afternoon.</p>
                <pb facs="0628" n="538" xml:id="pg538"/>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>“In authorized circles it is learned that the Italian Government has decided
                        to raise its diplomatic representation in China to rank of Embassy in order
                        to make it correspond with the importance of China as a great power and with
                        the importance of the political, economic and cultural relations between
                        Italy and China.[”]</p>
                </quote>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Long</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
